cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software (this repository)
  and the peer-reviewed paper listed under `preferred-citation`.
title: "Collaborative Intelligence Component (CI-Component)"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, web-based implementation of an agentic framework for Industry 5.0.
  The Collaborative Intelligence Component enables Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) decision
  making at the Edge, integrating Large Language Models (LLMs) for explainable data
  curation and one-click recalibration of Edge AI models over MQTT telemetry.
  Official implementation of the PRO-VE 2025 Best Paper Award-winning framework.
